  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "If the third term in the binomial expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;equals <math><mn>2560</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then a possible value of <math><mi>x</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "EbDbL",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KADmf",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "YBbIj",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><mi> </mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "JRwHU",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The general term in the expansion of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><msup><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi></msup><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Given, in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;third term is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2560</mn></math></p><p>Using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2560</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></math></p><p>Taking logarithm to the base <math><mn>2</mn></math> on both sides</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>256</mn></math></p><p>Now, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Here, only&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is given in the options.</p>",
